# M B002 — rules/angular.md, rules/api.md, rules/architecture.md (part)
1 CD FE-001 m=D k=P st=S c=M | angular.md:17-20: FE-001 standalone default; the NgModule exception is narrowed to "an integration or legacy dependency genuinely requires them" (exception scope narrower than a reasoned DEFAULT deviation).
  x: NgModules only when an integration or legacy dependency genuinely requires them
  s: A team wants an NgModule to group providers for one feature for a stated design reason unrelated to integration/legacy: admissible reasoned deviation under FE-001's DEFAULT; excluded by M's exception scope.
2 CD FE-001 m=D k=P st=S c=M | Same sentence (P/R wording): standalone APIs, feature organisation, no NgModules for ordinary feature development except integration/legacy need.
