39 CD ARC-028 m=MN k=P st=S c=M | ARC-028 limits test references to what the test scope requires; M adds a fixed per-test-project allow-list (Domain.Tests->Domain; Application.Tests->Application(+Domain); IntegrationTests->Api; Infrastructure.Tests->Infrastructure).
