41 XP m=D c=M rel=ARC-028,DEP-013,DEP-024 | Canonical set of backend test projects (<Name>.Domain.Tests optional, .Application.Tests, .IntegrationTests, .Infrastructure.Tests optional); policies fix framework and location, not the project set or names.
